    "sections": {
        "description": "Expert AC Repair is a professional, responsive, and user-friendly WordPress theme tailored for HVAC businesses, AC repair services, and maintenance experts. Its clean and minimal design offers a modern, clutter-free interface that emphasizes content and services. Built with optimized codes and secure and clean code, it ensures a faster page load time and seamless performance across all devices. This multipurpose theme includes features like a customizable banner, a testimonial section, Call to Action buttons (CTAs), and a Team section to showcase your technicians and build trust. Designed with Bootstrap and enhanced with animated effects, the theme provides an interactive, stunning visual experience for visitors. Whether you're offering cooling, heating, or ventilation services, this theme comes with extensive personalization options and shortcodes, allowing you to tailor the layout easily. It’s also translation-ready, SEO friendly, and Retina ready, making your site globally accessible and visually sharp. Social media integration and a mobile-friendly structure further enhance user engagement. The Expert AC Repair Theme combines luxurious, sophisticated aesthetics with powerful functionality, ideal for growing your online presence and reaching more customers efficiently."
    },
